<h2>Credits!</h2>
~B~E~lHey guys, Mike here.  Most of you netstorm players might know me as AustralianDingo.
<br>
<br>~B~E~iAt any rate, this was my first attempt at mapmaking.  I tried to make them all unique and keep the interest of the players.
<br>
<br>~B~E~qI made all five of these maps some long time ago, and just recently made a few minor changes (like this credits thing).
<br>
<br>~B~E~lFeel free to send any feedback to my primary email address at mikebyrne5@home.com.  You might also use my other email address (rarely ever checked) at mbyrne@tp.devry.edu.
<br>
<br>~B~E~iThanks again and see you guys in the netstorm zones.  

